cfd69.wav", "say": "For structured lifecycles, a JoinSet aborts unfinished tasks on drop, while a Semaphore caps in-flight concurrency. And when select races a timeout against an RPC, cancellation is not an exception \u2014 Rust simply drops the losing Future, running every destructor automatically.", "text": "For structured lifecycles, a join set aborts unfinished tasks on drop, while a semaphore caps in-flight concurrency. And when select races a timeout against an RPC, cancellation is not an exception \u2014 Rust simply drops the losing Future, running every destructor automatically.", "duration": 17.87, "hold": 0.4, "words": [{"text": "For", "start": 0.225, "end": 0.35}, {"text": "structured", "start": 0.35, "end": 0.812}, {"text": "lifecycles", "start": 0.812, "end": 1.625}, {"text": "a", "start": 1.725, "end": 1.837}, {"text": "join", "start": 1.837, "end": 2.15}, {"text": "set", "start": 2.15, "end": 2.375}, {"text": "aborts", "start": 2.375, "end": 2.775}, {"text": "unfinished", "start": 2.775, "end": 3.375}, {"text": "tasks", "start": 3.375, "end": 3.763}, {"text": "on", "start": 3.763, "end": 3.9}, {"text": "drop", "start": 3.9, "end": 4.5}, {"text": "while", "start": 4.6, "end": 4.787}, {"text": "a", "start": 4.787, "end": 4.862}, {"text": "semaphore", "start": 4.862, "end": 5.412}, {"text": "caps", "start": 5.412, "end": 5.775}, {"text": "in-flight", "start": 5.775, "end": 6.2}, {"text": "concurrency", "start": 6.2, "end": 7.125}, {"text": "And", "start": 7.745, "end": 7.882}, {"text": "when", "start": 7.882, "end": 8.057}, {"text": "select", "start": 8.057, "end": 8.52}, {"text": "races", "start": 8.52, "end": 8.883}, {"text": "a", "start": 8.883, "end": 8.945}, {"text": "timeout", "start": 8.945, "end": 9.37}, {"text": "against", "start": 9.37, "end": 9.682}, {"text": "an", "start": 9.682, "end": 9.758}, {"text": "RPC", "start": 9.758, "end": 10.545}, {"text": "cancellation", "start": 10.67, "end": 11.395}, {"text": "is", "start": 11.395, "end": 11.545}, {"text": "not", "start": 11.545, "end": 11.758}, {"text": "an", "start": 11.758, "end": 11.845}, {"text": "exception", "start": 11.845, "end": 12.87}, {"text": "Rust", "start": 13.008, "end": 13.495}, {"text": "simply", "start": 13.495, "end": 13.845}, {"text": "drops", "start": 13.845, "end": 14.195}, {"text": "the", "start": 14.195, "end": 14.32}, {"text": "losing", "start": 14.32, "end": 14.695}, {"text": "Future", "start": 14.695, "end": 15.32}, {"text": "running", "start": 15.42, "end": 15.732}, {"text": "every", "start": 15.732, "end": 16.045}, {"text": "destructor", "start": 16.045, "end": 16.62}, {"text": "automatically", "start": 16.62, "end": 17.645}]}]}, {"id": "finale", "title": "Ownership is Rust's concurrency model", "beats": [{"wav": "finale-0-6ba12260c402.wav", "say": "Put it all together in a real service: async ingesters gated by a Semaphore feed owned batches through a bounded mpsc channel to an actor that owns its state with zero mutexes, answering queries over oneshot and draining cleanly on a CancellationToken. Ownership is not bolted onto Rust concurrency. Ownership is Rust's concurrency model.", "text": "Put it all together in a real service: async ingesters gated by a semaphore feed owned batches through a bounded M P S C channel to an actor that owns its state with zero mutexes, answering queries over one shot and draining cleanly on a cancellation token. Ownership is not bolted onto Rust concurrency. Ownership is Rust's concurrency model.", "duration": 22.74, "hold": 1.6, "words": [{"text": "Put", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.312}, {"text": "it", "start": 0.312, "end": 0.388}, {"text": "all", "start": 0.388, "end": 0.575}, {"text": "together", "start": 0.575, "end": 1.025}, {"text": "in", "start": 1.025, "end": 1.113}, {"text": "a", "start": 1.113, "end": 1.175}, {"text": "real", "start": 1.175, "end": 1.45}, {"text": "service", "start": 1.45, "end": 2.275}, {"text": "async", "start": 2.413, "end": 2.8}, {"text": "ingesters", "start": 2.8, "e